Dear Colleagues,

We have received the tender for DARAMIC via A/C PRIMOCARGO.  Here are some basic data for your easier reference:

- validity:  1 Jan 2014 until 31 Jan 2015
- ~ 3400 TEU in year 2013
        rough breakdown (brief overview of 2013 volumes only):
                - AESW   73 TEU
                - AESE  700 TEU
                - IES      69 TEU
                - TASW  96 TEU
                - TASE   28 TEU
                - TPSE    50 TEU
                - IAS    1382 TEU
                plus others, e.g. TPSW, IMS

- deadline is 26 Nov 2013

Please check the enclosed  tender file to see actual volumes and trade lanes / routes.  We need to have your comments, in how far you would like to support the tender or not.  Obviously, key volumes are within IAS as well as AESE trade, i.e. should we not find the tender interesting in these trades, it makes probably no sense to further process the inquiry.

Please let us have your comments by Friday, 22 Nov.  In case positive, we need to prepare our reply within Monday the following week.


Thanks and regards,
HAMUSW / Gordon Valentiner
Sales Beyond the Ocean Rates
